<title>USA: Northern Trust Corp Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Northern Trust Corp Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.58		    $0.51</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.58		    $0.50</p>
<p> Net			 67,400		   59,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     114,196		  113,203</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     114,392		  116,276</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1996 net interest income $108.4 million vs $100.7 million. Q4 1996 total non-interest income $200.7 million vs $174.6 million.  </p>
<p>Assets $21.61 billion vs $19.93 billion</p>
<p>Deposits $3.89 billion vs $3.31 billion</p>
<p>Loans and leases $10.94 billion vs $9.91 billion</p>
<p>		     YEAR</p>
<p> Shr primary		$2.21		    $1.88</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$2.20		    $1.85</p>
<p> Net			258,800		  220,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     114,648		  112,676</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     115,467		  116,138</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>Full-year 1996 net interest income $421.9 million vs $395.2 million. Full-year 1996 total non-interest income $777.9 million vs $678.1 million.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
